2026-10-31T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2372) 'What stays allowed
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2372  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2372) 'Fragment shaders that render are fine, and Python bindings serve upstream contributions and their tests, never a pipeline.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2372  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-2372) 'What is off the route
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2372  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-2372) 'A native ggml engine module, a GDExtension ggml API or a standalone runtime is off the route, and a standalone CLI may stay as a CPU oracle for a gate.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2372  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-2372) 'Diffusion
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
